Purpose
-------
Anyone may use WinTAKTracker at no cost for the application itself. Nobody may
charge for the application or sell licenses to it. Source stays publicly
available. Forks of this software also must not charge for the application.
Solution providers may charge for their time (install, manage, train, support)
— just not for the software itself.

1. Definitions

   “Software” means the WinTAKTracker source code and binaries in this
   repository, including modified versions and derivatives.

   “Sell the Software” means to charge a fee, accept payment, or otherwise
   commercially license or distribute the Software (or a fork/derivative) as a
   product — including paid downloads, SaaS access fees for the app itself, or
   selling licenses to use the Software. It does not include charging only for
   separate human services described in Section 3.

2. Grant

